g":"刘恭","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"950ec580-db0e-11ef-95be-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":117,"link_td_description":"刘恭，东汉明帝的第三子。","link_td_id":"Q10002852","link_td_number_id":1570257,"people_name":"靈壽王","people_name_jianti_auto":"灵寿王","people_xingming":"刘恭","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"950ec581-db0e-11ef-8dd3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":58,"link_death_year":96,"link_td_description":"刘党，东汉明帝的第四子，生母不详。","link_td_id":"Q10002851","link_td_number_id":1570296,"people_name":"黨","people_name_jianti_auto":"党","people_xingming":"刘党","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"950ec582-db0e-11ef-94ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":58,"link_death_year":96,"link_td_description":"刘党，东汉明帝的第四子，生母不详。","link_td_id":"Q10002851","link_td_number_id":1570296,"people_name":"重熹王","people_name_jianti_auto":"重熹王","people_xingming":"刘党","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"950ec583-db0e-11ef-b9c8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3賜皇子恭號曰靈壽王，黨號曰重熹王，未有國邑。","content_fanyi":"明帝赐皇子刘恭封号为灵寿王，赐刘党封号为重熹王，但都没有封国和食邑。","content_jianti_auto":"3赐皇子恭号曰灵寿王，党号曰重熹王，未有国邑。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3576,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"950ec57d-db0e-11ef-b3ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"950ec586-db0e-11ef-a88e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：以非列侯，故曰小侯。禮記曰「庶方小侯」，亦其義也。余據東平王蒼傳，送列侯印十九枚，諸王子年五歲以上能趨拜者，皆令帶之。意四姓小侯亦猶是也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：以非列侯，故曰小侯。礼记曰「庶方小侯」，亦其义也。余据东平王苍传，送列侯印十九枚，诸王子年五岁以上能趋拜者，皆令带之。意四姓小侯亦犹是也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"950ec585-db0e-11ef-8773-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"皇太子","official_note":"皇太子是皇帝的继承人，在汉代通常不视为正式官职，但具有重要政治地位。此处指皇帝崇尚儒学，皇太子作为皇室成员参与受经学习，体现教育推广。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"自皇太子諸王侯及大臣子弟、功臣子孫","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"18df1d60-6d35-40d4-b05d-2e19bedd298d"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"期門","official_note":"期门是汉代宫廷侍卫官，负责皇帝出行时的护卫，属于军事系统。此处指期门士兵被要求通晓《孝经》，反映儒学教育的普及。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"自期門、羽林之士","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"36938472-b4a0-4d3b-84d8-5d458673a590"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"羽林","official_note":"羽林是汉代禁卫军，负责宫廷守卫，属于军事系统。此处指羽林士兵被要求通晓《孝经》，体现儒学教育扩展到军事人员。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"自期門、羽林之士","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"d44e7b36-975e-4c68-9315-21902428f00a"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"樊氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"樊氏","people_xingming":"樊氏","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"950ec589-db0e-11ef-99b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"郭氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭氏","people_xingming":"郭氏","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"950ec58a-db0e-11ef-937d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陰氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"阴氏","people_xingming":"阴氏","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"950ec58b-db0e-11ef-9624-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":40,"link_death_year":79,"link_td_description":"明德皇后，伏波将军马援小女，母蔺氏，名不详，汉明帝刘庄的皇后，撰《显宗起居注》。","link_td_id":"Q10001122","link_td_number_id":501420,"people_name":"馬氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"马氏","people_xingming":"马氏","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"950ec58c-db0e-11ef-821b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"95110f8b-db0e-11ef-b7fe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与匈奴的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0608"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4帝崇尚儒學，自皇太子諸王侯及大臣子弟、功臣子孫，莫不受經。又爲外戚樊氏、郭氏、陰氏、馬氏諸子立學於南宮，號「四姓小侯」。置五經師，搜選高能以授其業。自期門、羽林之士，悉令通孝經章句。匈奴亦遣子入學。","content_fanyi":"汉明帝尊崇儒学，自皇太子、各封国王侯以及大臣子弟、功臣子孙，无不研习儒经。又为外戚樊氏、郭氏、阴氏、马氏诸子弟在南宫建立贵族学馆，称作“四姓小侯”。设置五经师傅，挑选才学优秀者教授他们的学业。从期门、羽林的武士起，一律令其通晓《孝经》章句。匈奴也派遣贵族子弟到汉朝入学。","content_jianti_auto":"4帝崇尚儒学，自皇太子诸王侯及大臣子弟、功臣子孙，莫不受经。又为外戚樊氏、郭氏、阴氏、马氏诸子立学于南宫，号「四姓小侯」。置五经师，搜选高能以授其业。自期门、羽林之士，悉令通孝经章句。匈奴亦遣子入学。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3577,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"950ec584-db0e-11ef-80a1-a0d3651f611f","zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000700"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"恐其復謀不軌，故不得臣屬吏民，唯食國之租稅。","note_content_jianti_auto":"恐其复谋不轨，故不得臣属吏民，唯食国之租税。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"9511285a-db0e-11ef-9609-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9511285e-db0e-11ef-93f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：春秋公羊傳之文也。將者，將爲弒逆之事也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：春秋公羊传之文也。将者，将为弑逆之事也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":182,"tongjian_id":"9511285d-db0e-11ef-bc19-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"荊","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆","sta